[32mDally Lane[37m.
[0;32;40mYou are standing on a dusty road with rising ground both to the north and south. Though dilapidated and disused, the route north of where you stand, with a building at the far end, looks as if it once formed a grand driveway. To the south, the road twists up the hill where, at the summit, an ancient walled monastery dominates the scene. Open fields lie to the west, and east is a flat area of lawn. [1;37;40m
